      [
        "Notes",
        "Insight46 phase 1 BRAIN test: a validated test for detecting signs of Parkinson's disease and other neurological conditions. Using a Lenovo Thinkpad laptop, participants were instructed to tap as fast and accurately as possible, alternating between the s and ; keys for thirty seconds, with each hand separately. In several cases, the hand used for each test may have been recorded incorrectly (indicated by a discrepancy between the data recorded by staff and the website).  This discrepancy has been coded with the variable \u201cBT_rightleftuncertain_15\u201c,the data is useable for analyses using a the mean of both hands, or \u201cworst hand\u201d analyses, but should be excluded if relationships with dominant or non-dominant hands are investigated. Also performed at phase 2 - see library file I46P2_braintap."
      ]
